## Model card

- **Name:** Pareto 26.10 Preview
- **Short description:** Unverified identity — no official model card, no public weights, no independent benchmark source confirms a model named "Pareto 26.10 Preview" released by Pareto AI (pareto.si, a Slovenian AI consulting firm). The slug `pareto-26.10-preview` appears in the dataset (`model-queue.md` score 84.3) but evidence is insufficient to confirm a distinct public model.
